    "summary_one_sentence": "When young mother Gemma discovers she can navigate the ominous realm of The Further and unwittingly manifest its malicious entities into the physical world, she must race to protect her daughter from the nightmare she has unleashed in her childhood home.",
    "summary_short": "Living in her childhood home with her young daughter, Gemma uncovers a harrowing secret about her connection to the supernatural realm known as The Further. Unlike other travelers, Gemma possesses the unique and perilous ability to bring the terrifying entities inhabiting the astral plane back into the physical world. As malicious spirits begin to bleed into her daily reality, she must confront her family's dark past and master her gift before forces from the afterlife claim her daughter.",
    "summary_long": "Gemma, a young mother, moves back into her childhood home to build a safe and comfortable life for her growing daughter. However, her peaceful existence begins to unravel as strange occurrences and terrifying night terrors plague the household. Through these haunting encounters, Gemma discovers that she possesses a dangerous latent gift: the ability to cross over into The Further. Unlike typical astral projection, Gemma's presence in the dark void carries grave consequences, as she can physically pull the malevolent creatures that dwell there into the waking realm. As these terrifying entities begin manifesting in her home, the safety of her daughter becomes direly compromised. Gemma struggles to understand the origin of her terrifying ability, realizing that her childhood home holds deep-seated secrets about her family's connection to the realm of the dead. Desperate to purge the evil taking root in her reality, she must repeatedly venture back into the oppressive darkness of The Further to fix what she broke. With each journey risking a tighter hold by the spirits on her physical life, Gemma fights an escalating war between realms to seal the bridge she unintentionally opened. Ultimately, she must find a way to sever her link to the ethereal void before the evil forces permanently tear her family apart.",
    "synopsis": "Insidious: Out of the Further expands the spine-chilling mythology of the Insidious universe by introducing Gemma, a young mother striving to raise her daughter in the quiet familiarity of her childhood home. What begins as unsettling occurrences quickly turns terrifying when Gemma realizes she can project her consciousness into The Further—the shrouded, purgatorial realm of the dead. However, Gemma’s connection to this dark plane is unnervingly unique: she holds the dangerous ability to draw the malicious entities dwelling within The Further out into the real world. Blending psychological horror, intense thriller beats, and emotional drama, the film follows Gemma’s desperate quest to protect her child from the malevolent forces bleeding into reality, forcing her to confront deep family secrets and master her terrifying gift before the bridge between life and death collapses forever.",
